# Node Documentation

This directory contains detailed documentation for every node category in the NodeEditor.

## Structure

```
nodes/
├── categories/
│   ├── Input/          readme     — File input nodes
│   ├── SubGraph/       readme     — Nested graph containers
│   ├── System/         readme     — OS, time, clipboard
│   ├── Math/           readme     — Arithmetic, trig, vectors, random
│   ├── Color/          readme     — Color creation, manipulation, palettes
│   ├── Data/           readme     — JSON, serialization, file I/O
│   ├── Logic/          readme     — Boolean operations, comparison
│   ├── Events/         readme     — Begin, tick, timer, signals
│   ├── Generators/     readme     — Waveforms, noise, camera
│   ├── Output/         readme     — Display, charts, debug, export
│   ├── Qt/             readme     — QObject, widgets, QML bridge
│   └── Utility/        readme     — Flow, value, collections, strings, hash
└── etc/                readme     — Stub/planned categories
    ├── cutome-node/    (template)  — Custom node documentation (user-created)
    └── engine/         (template)  — Engine documentation (user-created)
```

Each category `readme` contains:
- **Category overview** with color and node count
- **Subcategory breakdown** with color
- **Node reference table** with type ID, class name, inputs, outputs
- **Example usage** showing typical graph connections
- **Inline preview notes** for display nodes
